    "sourcePath": "concepts/provenance.md",
    "content": "\n# Provenance\n\nGenerated records expose the effective source repository label, relative path, local ref, and SHA-256 content hash. A hash is evidence about these bytes; it is not presented as a Git commit SHA.\n\n## Historical pages\n\nHistorical fixture pages use a separate immutable version identifier and never follow the working tree.\n",
