    "version": "next",
    "sourceId": "central",
    "sourcePath": "governance.md",
    "content": "\n# Governance\n\nPaper & Slate publishes documentation from a local, reviewable source set. This page records the boundaries that are\ncurrently evidenced by the documentation system; it is not a claim of institutional approval or production status.\n\n## Source review\n\nCentral pages are reviewed repository-owned Markdown. Each ingested page retains its source path, local ref, and\ncontent hash. Fixture, sibling-local, and future Git-imported pages remain separated from the reviewed central rendering\npath.\n\n## Versions and provenance\n\nSupported and historical versions remain independent records. A content hash identifies the recorded bytes; it is not\npresented as a Git commit SHA. Raw Markdown routes remain available for source inspection.\n\n## Honest status\n\nLocal checks can establish source shape, route behavior, rendering boundaries, and generated artifacts. They do not by\nthemselves establish deployment, legal review, provider activation, production monitoring, or factual approval.\n",
    "headings": [
      "Governance",
      "Source review",
      "Versions and provenance",
      "Honest status"
    ],
    "hash": "a9911e81ec9558599ae9d9054a460a9be7f49936f617a69a1f6f197b71484f2a",
    "sourceHash": "a9911e81ec9558599ae9d9054a460a9be7f49936f617a69a1f6f197b71484f2a",
